      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MADAM SERIOUS (8) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 5 length win at this track in a handy 25.49. Wide box to overcome but has the ability and in winning form. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. LEKTRA SOLO (5) found some support last start but struggled into fourth (25.65), beaten 1.5 lengths. Was in the money the start prior. Boasts two wins from four starts out of this box. Key runner on best form. JUNEAU SANGRIA (4) drew a squeeze box and was game in defeat when a close second, 0.6 lengths from the winner High Cobber (27.79) at Horsham. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from six attempts. Must be included in calculations. LEKTRA SKIP (7) is in the mix despite finishing out of the placings here last start.",
